values('PFQ-0004',1,'Two proposed projects each have positive business cases, but both need the same scarce specialists next quarter. Which question belongs most directly to portfolio management?','[{"id":"a","text":"Which specialist should complete today’s test task?"},{"id":"b","text":"Which defect should the delivery team fix first?"},{"id":"c","text":"Which combination and timing of investments best supports strategy within available capacity?"},{"id":"d","text":"Which attendance record should the operational supervisor update?"}]'::jsonb,'c','Portfolio management considers the strategic fit, balance and capacity of investments together. Assigning a test task and prioritising an individual defect are delivery decisions; routine attendance administration is an operational activity.')
