values('PFQ-0011',1,'A manager needs an agreed reference against which to monitor the integrated scope, schedule, resources and costs of delivery. What is this reference called?','[{"id":"a","text":"The deployment baseline."},{"id":"b","text":"The issue log."},{"id":"c","text":"The stakeholder contact directory."},{"id":"d","text":"The unapproved list of possible changes."}]'::jsonb,'a','The deployment baseline provides an agreed integrated reference for managing delivery and assessing change. Issue and contact records support particular activities; proposed changes are not part of the baseline until appropriately authorised.')
