values('PFQ-0015',1,'A team member needs to communicate a complex, disputed requirement and check that colleagues understand it. Which approach best supports that purpose?','[{"id":"a","text":"An interactive discussion supported by a clear written record of the agreed outcome."},{"id":"b","text":"A cryptic subject line with no explanation."},{"id":"c","text":"A message sent to an unrelated mailing list."},{"id":"d","text":"A notice that prevents recipients from asking questions."}]'::jsonb,'a','An interactive channel supports clarification, while a written record helps preserve the agreement. The method should suit the message and audience. Obscure, misdirected or one-way communication makes understanding harder.')
