values('PFQ-0016',1,'A steering group wants exception reports, while site users need practical instructions before transition. Which communication-plan decision is most useful?','[{"id":"a","text":"Send both groups every raw project file daily."},{"id":"b","text":"Assume a single technical report suits all audiences."},{"id":"c","text":"Specify each audience’s information needs, method, timing and responsibility."},{"id":"d","text":"Remove the user instructions because the steering group has priority."}]'::jsonb,'c','A communication plan identifies who needs what information, how and when it will be communicated, and who is responsible. Different needs justify different communication. More raw data or one report for everyone does not necessarily improve understanding.')
