values('PFQ-0026',1,'A schedule needs four technicians on Monday, but only two are available. Management permits the finish date to move and wants the resource cap respected. Which response best matches resource levelling?','[{"id":"a","text":"Keep all start dates fixed and assume capacity will appear."},{"id":"b","text":"Reschedule work around the available capacity, accepting a possible later finish."},{"id":"c","text":"Record a milestone as taking two technicians all week."},{"id":"d","text":"Change only the report colours while leaving the overload."}]'::jsonb,'b','Resource levelling schedules work within resource limits and may extend completion. Smoothing aims to use available float while respecting the required finish. Assuming extra capacity, misrepresenting milestones or changing presentation does not resolve the overload.')
