values('PFQ-0027',1,'A status report shows money spent so far but omits the expected remaining cost and finish date. What useful management information is missing?','[{"id":"a","text":"A forecast that helps assess the likely final position and necessary decisions."},{"id":"b","text":"Only a decorative cover page."},{"id":"c","text":"A guarantee that the original baseline cannot change."},{"id":"d","text":"A replacement for every detailed technical record."}]'::jsonb,'a','Progress reporting helps decision makers compare actual performance and forecasts with agreed plans. Spend to date alone cannot establish the likely outturn. A cover page or a promise does not supply that forecast, and a report does not replace all supporting records.')
